  "description": "Subject: SIENA longitudinal analysis for sub\u201101 (baseline visit)\n\nDear Team,\n\nFor the upcoming longitudinal brain\u2011change assessment we will run FSL\u2019s SIENA on the baseline scan of subject\u202fsub\u201101. The analysis will use the T1\u2011weighted image **sub\u201101_T1w.nii.gz** as the first time point and the T2\u2011weighted image **sub\u201101_T2w.nii.gz** as the second time point. A ventricle mask located at **ventricle_mask.nii.gz** is also available, although the ventricle\u2011based option will not be activated for this run. The command\u2011line options are set as follows: the brain extraction flag **\u2011B bet_options** is included, the bottom slice is specified with **\u2011b bottom_slice**, and the top slice with **\u2011t top_slice**. Debug mode is disabled, segmentation is enabled, and the T2\u2010weighted processing flag **\u2011t2** is turned on. The SS\u2011BET option (**\u2011m**) is left off, and the differential image will be written to **\u2011S diff_image.nii.gz**. The ventricle flag (**\u2011V**) is not used.\n\nPlease let me know if any adjustments are needed before we submit the job."
